          "copies/rp146dk0477.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil, in a fine cursive hand across the scanner's own horizontal lines. The month figure is settled by comparison with the 3 of 1352 in the same line; on its own it could be taken for a 5. A signature of roughly eight letters follows the date and I could not read it with any confidence, so it is left out of hand."
        }
       ]
